From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Mon, 12 Oct 2026 20:28:42 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] feat(desk): desk commission on school SMS top-ups

- chargeSmsTopUp: buyer must belong to the school (users/{uid}.schoolId == schoolId); asks PAY's deskSmsCommission for the
  desk split, attaches split_code, stores deskCommission on the pending doc (PAY's webhook writes the desk event at settlement)
- fails open: any desk problem = plain charge; reservation released if the charge never starts
- deskCommission.ts + tests; google-auth-library declared; desk-iam.sh grants the reverse invoker and prints DESK_SMS_PLAN_URL
- DEPLOYMENT.md step 4. Apply AFTER Register-desk-fixes.patch
